sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor B as Branch user
    participant P as Bank panel
    participant R as Core: Request + LockService
    participant DB as Oracle
    participant Y as Yaghut (technical account)
    participant M as Digital Signature + Farangin (manual)
    B->>P: open inbox
    P->>R: GET /api/branch/requests
    R->>DB: requests where user branch = branch_code or = handling branch
    R-->>P: actionable list + locked requests read-only with holder name
    B->>P: click Eqdam (take action)
    P->>R: POST .../{id}/lock
    R->>DB: SELECT FOR UPDATE NOWAIT
    alt ORA-00054 or locked_by is another user
        R-->>P: 409 another user is acting on this request
    end
    R->>DB: can_act check, UNDER_REVIEW, locked_by = me, audit LOCK
    R-->>P: details, inquiry results, collateral
    B->>P: approve
    P->>R: POST .../approve
    R->>Y: POST /deposit (re-check balances)
    alt balance no longer covers collateral
        R-->>P: 409 shortfall shown, approval blocked
    end
    R->>DB: NOWAIT, UNDER_ACTION, lock kept, audit
    R-->>P: 200
    B->>M: start signing session, customer signs in Mobilet, branch signs
    B->>M: issue guarantee in Farangin using the tracking code
    M-->>B: guarantee number
    B->>P: enter guarantee number
    P->>R: POST .../issue {guaranteeNumber}
    R->>DB: NOWAIT, format check, ISSUED, clear lock, outbox SMS 2, audit
    R-->>P: 200 issued
    Note over B,R: Abandon returns the request to pending branch review. Admin force-release is audited. An idle review lock is released after 60 min.
